  "intro": "Mr Adel needs the translation, and Daniel must send it by email. Arabic emails use fixed phrases. To someone you don't know well, start with حَضْرَةَ + the name + الْمُحْتَرَم (the respected), then the greeting تَحِيَّة طَيِّبَة وَبَعْدُ. Say what comes with the email with مُرْفَق (attached), and end with مَعَ أَطْيَبِ التَّحِيَّات (with best regards).",
  "objectives": [
